{"id":"level-up-2026-10-26","name":"2026-10-26 每日卡片","project":"level-up-cards","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/tree/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45","sentences":[{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-26:s1901","en":"She used warm water to remove the stain from the cloth.","zh":"她用温水去除了布上的污渍。","note":"remove · 排除，消除；搬迁，移动；开除，解除；距离， 间距 · remove a stain","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-26:s1902","en":"The lenient teacher accepted our homework a day late.","zh":"那位宽容的老师接受了我们迟交一天的作业。","note":"lenient · 宽大的， 宽容的； 厚道的， 仁慈的 · a lenient teacher","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-26:s1903","en":"The reviewer identified a fatal flaw in the argument.","zh":"评审者指出了论证中的一个致命缺陷。","note":"fatal · 致命的； 重大的； 命中注定的； 灾难性的 · a fatal flaw","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-26:s1904","en":"We continued to wrestle with the question of limited funding.","zh":"我们继续努力解决资金有限的问题。","note":"wrestle · 摔跤； 全力对付； 用力移动 · wrestle with","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-26:s1905","en":"The museum displayed a wooden coffer once used for valuables.","zh":"博物馆展出了一只曾用于存放贵重物品的木箱。","note":"coffer · 保险箱 · a wooden coffer","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-26:s1906","en":"Only the project manager can authorise payment for additional materials.","zh":"只有项目经理可以批准额外材料的付款。","note":"authorise · 批准， 认可； 授权 · authorise payment","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-26:s1907","en":"Her audacious plan was to cycle across the continent alone.","zh":"她大胆地计划独自骑车穿越这片大陆。","note":"audacious · 大胆的； 有冒险精神的； 鲁莽的； 厚颜无耻的 · an audacious plan","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-26:s1908","en":"The new tool helps volunteers perform repetitive tasks more efficiently.","zh":"新工具帮助志愿者更高效地完成重复性任务。","note":"perform · 履行， 执行， 完成； 表演， 演出； 运作 · perform a task","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-26:s1909","en":"The exhibition traces the evolution of bicycle design over time.","zh":"这个展览追溯了自行车设计随时间的演变。","note":"evolution · 进展； 进化 · the evolution of","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-26:s1910","en":"Reaching the summit filled us with a sense of exhilaration.","zh":"登上山顶让我们充满了兴奋之情。","note":"exhilaration · 高兴； 兴奋 · a sense of exhilaration","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-26:s1911","en":"The exhibition includes a section on the history of acupuncture.","zh":"这个展览包含一个介绍针灸历史的部分。","note":"acupuncture · 针刺疗法， 针灸 · the history of acupuncture","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-26:s1912","en":"We decided to make a complaint about the noisy ventilation system.","zh":"我们决定投诉噪声很大的通风系统。","note":"complaint · 抱怨； 投诉； 控告； 疾病 · make a complaint","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-26:s1913","en":"The village needs a reliable bus service throughout the year.","zh":"村庄全年都需要可靠的公交服务。","note":"service · 服务，帮助；公共设施，公用事业；维修，保养；行政部门，服务机构；维修， 保养 · a reliable service","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-26:s1914","en":"The new volunteers helped inject energy into the struggling project.","zh":"新志愿者帮助为这个进展艰难的项目注入活力。","note":"inject · 注射； 注入， 灌输 · inject energy into","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-26:s1915","en":"The television channel broadcast a documentary about local wildlife.","zh":"这个电视频道播出了一部关于当地野生动物的纪录片。","note":"channel · 频道； · a television channel","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-26:s1916","en":"Today's workshop will focus on improving the clarity of diagrams.","zh":"今天的工作坊将重点讨论如何提高图表的清晰度。","note":"focus · 聚焦，集中；焦点， 焦距； 中心 · focus on","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-26:s1917","en":"The tiny marks were almost invisible to the naked eye.","zh":"这些微小的痕迹几乎无法用肉眼看到。","note":"invisible · 看不见的， 无形的 · invisible to","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-26:s1918","en":"Missing information continued to hamper progress on the restoration.","zh":"信息缺失继续阻碍修复工作的进展。","note":"hamper · 妨碍，阻挠；有盖的大篮子； 盒装食物 · hamper progress","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-26:s1919","en":"The museum photographed its entire collection before moving premises.","zh":"博物馆搬迁前，为全部藏品拍了照。","note":"entire · 全部的， 整个的 · the entire collection","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-26:s1920","en":"Her practical approach helped the team solve the problem quickly.","zh":"她务实的方法帮助团队迅速解决了问题。","note":"approach · 靠近，接近；来临；靠近， 接近； 方法， 途径 · a practical approach","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-26:s1921","en":"The final mistake should not overshadow the team's earlier achievements.","zh":"最后的失误不应掩盖团队此前的成绩。","note":"overshadow · 给…蒙上阴影； 使扫兴； 使黯然失色 · overshadow achievements","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-26:s1922","en":"The shorter journey was a decisive factor in choosing this flat.","zh":"更短的通勤路程是选择这套公寓的决定性因素。","note":"decisive · 决定性的； 果断的 · a decisive factor","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-26:s1923","en":"Bees help pollinate flowers throughout the community garden.","zh":"蜜蜂帮助社区花园里的各种花授粉。","note":"pollinate · 【植】 给…授粉 · pollinate flowers","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-26:s1924","en":"The photograph shows a camel caravan crossing the desert.","zh":"照片上是一支正在穿越沙漠的骆驼队。","note":"camel · 骆驼 · a camel caravan","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-26:s1925","en":"Her doctoral thesis examines changes in coastal farming communities.","zh":"她的博士论文研究了沿海农业社区的变化。","note":"thesis · 论文 · a doctoral thesis","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-26:s1926","en":"The suitcase wheels caught on a small bump in the pavement.","zh":"行李箱轮子被人行道上一处小凸起绊住了。","note":"bump · 碰，撞；颠簸着前进；碰撞； 隆起物 · a small bump","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-26:s1927","en":"Wildflowers grew along the steep railway embankment behind the houses.","zh":"房屋后方陡峭的铁路路堤上长满了野花。","note":"embankment · 筑堤； 堤岸， 路基 · a railway embankment","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-26:s1928","en":"The concert helped revive his interest in playing the piano.","zh":"这场音乐会帮助他重新燃起了弹钢琴的兴趣。","note":"revive · 苏醒， 复活； 重新使用 · revive an interest","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-26:s1929","en":"The advertisement lists the hourly wage and expected working hours.","zh":"招聘广告列出了时薪和预计工作时间。","note":"wage · 工资； · an hourly wage","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-26:s1930","en":"The cloud formed an amorphous shape above the distant hills.","zh":"远处山丘上方的云形成了一个不规则的轮廓。","note":"amorphous · 无固定形状的； 无组织的 · an amorphous shape","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-26:s1931","en":"We can proceed with the repairs once the materials arrive.","zh":"材料到货后，我们就可以继续维修。","note":"proceed · 进行； 前进； 继续 · proceed with","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-26:s1932","en":"The caretaker climbed a ladder to replace the broken bulb.","zh":"管理员爬上梯子，更换坏掉的灯泡。","note":"bulb · 灯泡 · replace a bulb","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-26:s1933","en":"Friendly service helped the small shop build customer loyalty.","zh":"友好的服务帮助这家小商店建立了顾客忠诚度。","note":"loyalty · 忠诚， 忠心 · customer loyalty","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-26:s1934","en":"The committee should not dismiss her suggestion without discussing it.","zh":"委员会不应未经讨论就否定她的建议。","note":"dismiss · 解雇， 解散； 驳回， 不受理 · dismiss a suggestion","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-26:s1935","en":"The investigation sought to identify the underlying cause of the delays.","zh":"调查试图查明延误背后的根本原因。","note":"underlying · 表面下的， 下层的， 在下面的； 根本的； 潜在的， 隐含的 · an underlying cause","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-26:s1936","en":"Please send written confirmation of the revised delivery date.","zh":"请以书面形式确认修改后的送货日期。","note":"confirmation · 证实， 确认； 批准 · written confirmation","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-26:s1937","en":"The seminar explored how artificial intelligence might change museum cataloguing.","zh":"研讨会探讨人工智能可能如何改变博物馆的编目工作。","note":"intelligence · 智力， 理解力； 情报 · artificial intelligence","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-26:s1938","en":"Student enrolment increased after the college introduced evening courses.","zh":"学院开设夜间课程后，学生入学人数增加了。","note":"enrolment · 登记， 注册； 入学， 入伍； 登记簿， 名册 · student enrolment","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-26:s1939","en":"We hired a carpenter to install shelves in the alcove.","zh":"我们请了一位木匠在壁凹里安装架子。","note":"install · 安顿， 安置； 安装， 设置； 正式任命， 使正式就职 · install a shelf","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-26:s1940","en":"His refusal to listen seemed a clear display of arrogance.","zh":"他拒绝倾听，显得十分傲慢。","note":"arrogance · 傲慢， 自大 · a display of arrogance","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-26:s1941","en":"A new parking restriction applies outside the school entrance.","zh":"学校入口外开始实施新的停车限制。","note":"restriction · 限制， 约束 · a parking restriction","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-26:s1942","en":"Falling visitor numbers were an early indication of the problem.","zh":"游客数量下降是这一问题的早期迹象。","note":"indication · 指示， 象征 · an early indication","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-26:s1943","en":"The café buys coffee beans in bulk to reduce costs.","zh":"这家咖啡馆批量购买咖啡豆，以降低成本。","note":"bulk · 大量； 大批 · buy in bulk","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-26:s1944","en":"The museum advertised a vacancy for a part-time guide.","zh":"博物馆发布了兼职导览员的招聘信息。","note":"vacancy · 空位， 空房间； 空缺， 空职； 无主意， 空虚， 茫然若失 · a job vacancy","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-26:s1945","en":"The national champion returned to her old school for a visit.","zh":"这位全国冠军回到了以前的学校参观。","note":"champion · 冠军 · a national champion","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-26:s1946","en":"She served the soup in a handmade ceramic bowl.","zh":"她用一只手工陶碗盛汤。","note":"ceramic · 陶器的 · a ceramic bowl","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-26:s1947","en":"Each ancient artefact was carefully labelled before entering the collection.","zh":"每件古代文物在入藏前都被仔细贴好了标签。","note":"artefact · 人工制品， 手工艺品 · an ancient artefact","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-26:s1948","en":"The information booklet includes a map and suggested walking routes.","zh":"这本信息手册包含一张地图和推荐步行路线。","note":"booklet · 小册子 · an information booklet","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-26:s1949","en":"The tower offers a magnificent view of the surrounding countryside.","zh":"登上塔楼可以欣赏周围乡村的壮丽景色。","note":"magnificent · 壮丽的， 宏伟的， 华丽的； 高尚的 · a magnificent view","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-26:s1950","en":"The museum may restrict access to fragile areas during repairs.","zh":"维修期间，博物馆可能限制进入脆弱区域。","note":"restrict · 限制， 约束 · restrict access","recordings":[]}],"words":[{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-26:w1901","en":"remove","zh":"排除，消除；搬迁，移动；开除，解除；距离， 间距","note":"英 /rɪ'muːv/ · 美 /rɪ'muv/","recordings":[{"label":"词条英音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/1901-uk-d48fd84383da.mp3","text":"remove"},{"label":"词条美音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/1901-us-89e6e8188140.mp3","text":"remove"}]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-26:w1902","en":"lenient","zh":"宽大的， 宽容的； 厚道的， 仁慈的","note":"英 /'liːnɪənt/ · 美 /'linɪənt/","recordings":[{"label":"词条英音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/1902-uk-8cf276c08dcd.mp3","text":"lenient"},{"label":"词条美音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/1902-us-310ede34fed8.mp3","text":"lenient"}]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-26:w1903","en":"fatal","zh":"致命的； 重大的； 命中注定的； 灾难性的","note":"英 /'feɪtl/ · 美 /'fetl/","recordings":[{"label":"词条英音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/1903-uk-3f308b188c91.mp3","text":"fatal"},{"label":"词条美音","u